
# Pandas Single-Sheet Cheat Sheet

```python
import pandas as pd
```

## 1. Creating / Loading Data

| Operation              | Syntax                           |
| ---------------------- | -------------------------------- |
| CSV → DataFrame        | `pd.read_csv("file.csv")`        |
| Excel → DataFrame      | `pd.read_excel("file.xlsx")`     |
| JSON → DataFrame       | `pd.read_json("file.json")`      |
| SQL → DataFrame        | `pd.read_sql(query, connection)` |
| Dictionary → DataFrame | `pd.DataFrame(data)`             |
| List → DataFrame       | `pd.DataFrame(list_data)`        |
| Series                 | `pd.Series(data)`                |
| Date range             | `pd.date_range(...)`             |
| Read clipboard         | `pd.read_clipboard()`            |

---

# 2. Exporting / Saving

| Operation  | Syntax                                  |
| ---------- | --------------------------------------- |
| CSV        | `df.to_csv("file.csv", index=False)`    |
| Excel      | `df.to_excel("file.xlsx", index=False)` |
| JSON       | `df.to_json("file.json")`               |
| SQL        | `df.to_sql(...)`                        |
| Dictionary | `df.to_dict()`                          |
| List       | `df.to_list()`                          |
| Clipboard  | `df.to_clipboard()`                     |

