# The important distinction

Don't try to memorize this entire sheet.

There are basically **three things** you need to distinguish:

```text
                 PANDAS
                   │
       ┌───────────┴───────────┐
       │                       │
      pd.                     df
       │                       │
Functions                 DataFrame methods
       │                       │
pd.read_csv()             df.head()
pd.to_datetime()          df.sort_values()
pd.merge()                df.groupby()
pd.concat()               df.drop()
pd.DataFrame()            df.fillna()
                           df.to_csv()
```

And then there are **Series operations**:

```python
df["salary"].mean()
df["salary"].max()
df["name"].str.upper()
df["state"].value_counts()
```




